WEBVTT

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:32.863
as one of the important interventions
for hyper immune responses,

00:09:32.863 --> 00:09:39.063
I mean, Indian doctors were using steroids
right at the start of the disease, OK?

00:09:39.363 --> 00:09:44.330
And then we were trying
everything possible in a very logical way,

00:09:44.363 --> 00:09:47.930
whether it was basically blood thinners,

00:09:47.963 --> 00:09:52.330
whether it was low molecular weight
heparins to prevent clotting.

00:09:52.363 --> 00:09:54.997
As they learned about how this
disease was working,

00:09:54.997 --> 00:09:58.563
they were willing to use
these kind of therapeutics

00:09:58.597 --> 00:10:02.363
to try and deal with these patients
and their problems.